msgstr "[bulletlist][bullet/]Ao ser colocado, transforma o terreno em Desolado.[bullet/]Por província de Ruína adjacente, ganha:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{amount1} {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount2} {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount3} {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount4} {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount5} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+{amount6} {GLOBAL.StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist][bullet/]Permite o alistamento de {GLOBAL.UNITS.ACCURSED_OGRE.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.UNITS.ACCURSED_BLADE.Hyperlink} e {GLOBAL.UNITS.ACCURSED_TRICKSTER.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Conta como um {GLOBAL.ConduitConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

